Skill effect catalog. IDs are assigned in skill_definitions.event.
========================================
AI Skills
========================================

Provoke: Enemies are more likely to target this unit.  [Tequila]
Shade: Enemies are less likely to target this unit.  [Sme]
Shade+: Enemies will not target this unit.  [Sme]

========================================
Aura Skills
========================================

Anathema: -10 Avoid/Dodge to all enemies within 3 tiles.  [Initial Commit]
Blood Tide: Atk and Hit +5 to adjacent allies.  [Sme]
Charisma: Grants +10 Hit/Avoid to all allies within three tiles.  [Darrman]
Charm: Allies within 2 tiles deal +2 damage.  [Initial Commit]
Daunt: -5 Hit and Crit to all enemy units in a 3-tile radius.  [Sme]
Demoiselle: Male allies within 2 tiles receive -2 damage.  [Initial Commit]
Drive Skills: Allies within 2 spaces receive +4 to their respective stat.  [Sme]
Focus: +10 Critical if there are no allies within 3 tiles.  [Initial Commit]
Gentilhomme: Female allies within 2 tiles receive -2 damage.  [Initial Commit]
Hex: -15 avoid to all adjacent enemies.  [Snakey1]
Infiltrator: If within 2 spaces of two or more enemies, gain +3 damage and +15% hit.  [Datagne]
Inspiration: Allies within 2 tiles deal +2 damage and receive -2 damage.  [Initial Commit]
Divinely Inspiring: Adjacent allies deal +3 damage and receive -1 damage.  [Dragz]
Intimidate: -10 Avoid to all enemies within 2 tiles.  [Initial Commit]
Lily's Poise: Adjacent allies gain +1/-3 damage dealt/received.  [Initial Commit]
Malefic Aura: Enemies within 2 tiles receive +2 magic damage.  [Initial Commit]
Night Tide: Def and Res +5 to adjacent allies.  [Sme]
Solidarity: Critical and Critical Avoid +10 to adjacent allies.  [SD9k]
Spur Skills: Adjacent allies gain +4 to their respective stat.  [Initial Commit]
Tantivy: +10 Hit/Avoid if there are no allies within 3 tiles.  [Initial Commit]
Up With Arch: Adjacent ally units gain might equal to half this unit's might. (Only if name starts with "Arch")  [Initial Commit]
Voice of Peace: Enemies within 2 tiles deal -2 damage.  [Initial Commit]
White Pool: Atk and AS +5 to adjacent allies.  [Sme]
Skyguard: +4 defense against flying enemies if within 3 spaces of an ally flier.  [Sme]
Horseguard: +4 defense against horseback enemies if within 3 spaces of an ally horse rider.  [Sme]
Armorboost: +4 attack and defense against armored enemies if within 3 spaces of an armored ally.  [Sme]

========================================
Turn Skills
========================================

Rally Chaos: At the start of your turn, perform a random rally.  [Vesly]
Hoarder's Bane: At the end of your turn, consume a vulnerary from the supply if below full health.  [Vesly]
Dark Bargain: At the end of your turn, sacrifice extra exp to heal by that much.  [Vesly]

========================================
Buff Skills
========================================

Eternal Vanity: Your buffed stats do not deplete each turn.  [Vesly]
_ Taker: After attacking and defeating an enemy, gain +4 _. (Max +10  [Vesly]
Hone _ : At the start of your turn, give adjacent allies up to +3 _.  [Vesly]
_ Oath : At the start of your turn, gain up to +4 _ if adjacent to an ally.  [Vesly]
Rouse _ : At the start of your turn, gain up to +4 _ if not adjacent to an ally.  [Vesly]
_ Initiative: Begin the chapter with +7 __.  [Vesly]
Even/Odd Footed: +1 Mov on Even/Odd turns  [Jopettajah]

========================================
Debuff Skills
========================================

Seal Skills: Debuff opponent's stat by 6 after combat. (Recover 1/turn)  [Initial Commit, Snakey1]
Full Metal Body: This unit is immune to all the Seal skills.  [Leonarth]

========================================
Effectiveness Skills
========================================

Nullify: Unit is protected from all effective attacks.  [Tequila]
Slayer: Deal effective damage to monster units.  [Tequila]
Skybreaker: Deal effective damage to flying units.  [Sme]
Resourceful: Double effectiveness multiplier.  [Sme]

========================================
EXP Skills
========================================

Paragon: Experience gain is doubled.  [Initial Commit]
Void Curse: This unit gives no experience when defeated.  [Sme]

========================================
Growth Skills
========================================

Blossom: 2x growth rates, but 1/2 exp gain.  [Sme]
Aptitude: +20% to all growth rates.  [Sme]

========================================
HP Restoration Skills
========================================

Renewal: Restore 30% of max HP at the start of each turn.  [Initial Commit]
Amaterasu: Allies within 2 tiles recover 20% HP each turn.  [Initial Commit]
Camaraderie: Recover 10% HP each turn if there are allies within 2 tiles.  [Initial Commit]
Relief: Recover 20% HP each turn if there are no allies within 2 tiles.  [Initial Commit]
Bond: All allies within 3 tiles recover 10% HP each turn.  [Initial Commit]
Forager: Recover 20% HP each turn if on a Plain, Forest or Mountain.  [Leonarth]
Imbue: Recover HP equal to Magic at the start of each turn.  [Sme]

========================================
Movement Skills
========================================

Acrobat: All traversable terrain costs 1 movement.  [Tequila]
Armor March: At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to an armor ally, unit and adjacent armor allies gain +2 Mov.  [Leonarth]
Pass: Can move through enemy units.  [Tequila]
Keep Up: At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of an ally with Canto or Canto+, unit gains +2 Mov.  [Sme]
Indoor March: At start of turn, if unit is on indoor terrain, unit gains +2 Mov.  [Sme]
Nature Rush: At start of turn, if unit is on natural terrain, unit gains +2 Mov.  [Sme]

========================================
Mug-Loading Skills
========================================

Quantum Visage: Face changes every time it's looked at.  [Leonarth]
Identity Problems: This unit can't decide on a name or face.  [Leonarth]

========================================
Post-Battle Skills
========================================

Breath of Life: After attacking,allies in 2 tiles heal of 20% max HP.  [circleseverywhere]
Canto: Can move again after certain actions.  [Tequila]
Canto+: Can move again after attacking and other actions.  [Tequila]
Despoil: Obtain a Red Gem after attacking and defeating an enemy. (Luck % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Fury: +2 Atk/Spd/Def/Res. Unit takes 6 damage after combat.  [circleseverywhere]
Galeforce: Move again after attacking and defeating an enemy.  [Initial Commit]
Fail 'n Gale: Move again after attacking but failing to harm an enemy.  [Vesly]
Lifetaker: Restore up to 25% HP after attacking and defeating an enemy.  [Initial Commit]
Poison Strike: Deals damage equal to 20% of the enemy's max HP after battle this unit initiates.  [Snakey1]
Grisly Wound: Deals damage equal to 20% of the enemy's max HP after every battle.  [Snakey1]
Powerstaff: Get another action after using a staff.  [Sme]
Re-Move: Luck% chance to get another action at end of turn.  [Sme]
Savage Blow: After attacking, enemies within 2 tiles take 20% damage.  [circleseverywhere]
Cultured: If unit attacks next to a unit with Nice Thighs, move again. -50 hit against units with Nice Thighs.  [Sme]
Gridmaster: Movement skills do not end your action.  [Sme]

