Pre-Battle Skills
========================================

AxeFaith: Axes can't lose durability, and grants +Luck*1.5 Hit when wielding axes.  [2WB & Colorz]
Battle Veteran: Gain +1 damage and +5% Hit per 10 levels unit has.  [Datagne]
