Breaker Skills: +50 Hit/Avo when enemy has the specified weapon type equipped.  [Rossendale]
Charge: Gain +1 damage for every two squares moved.  [Datagne]
Charge+: Charge+: If unit has used up all movement, gain brave effect.  [Sme]
