Killing Machine: Total critical rate is doubled.  [Initial Commit]
Crit Boost: +15 critical rate.  [Initial Commit]
Strong Riposte: When under attack, damage +3.  [Initial Commit]
Patience: When under attack, avoid +10.  [Initial Commit]
Pursuit: When under attack, attack speed +2.  [Initial Commit]
Chivalry: When foe is at full HP, attack and def/res +2.  [Initial Commit]
Pragmatic: When foe is not at full HP, attack +3 and def/res+1.  [Initial Commit]
