Indoor/Outdoor Fighter: +10 Hit and Avo when fighting indoors/outdoors.  [Sme]
Elbow Room: +3 damage dealt when on open terrain.  [Initial Commit]
Even/Odd Rhythm: +10 Hit and Avoid on even or odd numbered turns.  [Initial Commit]
Faire Skills: +4 damage when equipping a weapon of the specified type.  [Initial Commit]
Fiery Blood: +4 damage when HP is not at max.  [Initial Commit]
Foreign Princess: Foreign army units take -2/+2 damage dealt/taken.  [Sme]
Fortune: This unit cannot be crit.  [Sme]
Frenzy: For every 4 damage taken, +1 to damage dealt.  [Tequila]
EyesOfHawk: User will always hit the enemy.  [SD9k]
Heavy Strikes: Add weapon weight to critical chance.  [Datagne]
Holy Aura: Gain +1 damage, +5% hit, +5% avoid, +5% crit when using light.  [Datagne]
Insight: Hit +20.  [Sme]
Knight Aspirant: When above 75% health, +2 damage, +15% avoid.  [Datagne]
Life and Death: +10 to damage dealt and taken.  [Initial Commit]
Light Weight: When holding three or less items, attack speed +3.  [Initial Commit]
Loyalty: When within 2 spaces of a Lord, -3 damage taken, +15% hit.  [Datagne]
Lucky Seven: +20 Hit and Avoid until the 7th turn.  [Initial Commit]
Mage Slayer: Gain +2 damage and +10% crit when facing magical enemies.  [Datagne]
Natural Cover: -3 damage taken when on terrain with effects.  [Initial Commit]
Opportunist: +4 damage if the foe cannot counter.  [Tequila]
Outrider: Take -1 damage and gain +3% crit per space moved.  [Datagne]
Note: It should be noted that mountains, peaks, forests and other such tiles that impede movement will reduce the benefits of the skill propotionately
Perfectionist: +15 Hit/Avoid when user's HP is at maximum.  [Zeta]
Prescience: When initiating battle, Hit and Avo +15.  [Sme]
Puissance: +3 Damage when the user's Strength is higher than the enemy's.  [Zeta]
Quick Riposte: If defending and HP is 50% or higher, unit doubles and attacker does not double.  [Sme]
Quick/Slow Burn: Hit and Avoid bonus increasing or decreasing each turn, maximum +15.  [Initial Commit]
Short Shield: Gain 6 defense against attacks received in melee.  [Sme]
Silent Pride: Gain 2 damage and take -2 damage per 25% below max HP.  [Datagne]
Stance Skills: Bonus to stats when defending.  [Snakey1, Sme]
Thunderstorm: If weapon weight > enemy W. Weight, +2 dmg, +15% hit, +5% crit.  [Datagne]
Tower Shield: Gain 6 defense against attacks received at range.  [Sme]
Tower Shield+: Take no damage against attacks received at range.  [Sme]
Trample: +5 damage to unmounted units.  [Tequila]
Vanity: Gain +2 Damage and +10 Hit when fighting enemy at 2 range.  [Datagne]
Vigilance: Avoid +20.  [Sme]
Wind Disciple: +10 Hit and Avoid when HP is not at max.  [Initial Commit]
Wrath: If HP < 50%, +20 critical rate.  [Initial Commit]
Quick Draw: +4 Damage when initiating battle.  [Initial Commit]
Arcane Blade: When initiating battle at 1 range: Add 3+(Mag/2 to Hit and Crit.  [Zeta]
Blue Flame: Attack +2. When adjacent to an ally, Attack +4.  [Sme]
Double Lion: All weapons are treated as brave.  [Sme]
Thighdeology: If a unit within 3 tiles has Nice Thighs, gain +2 Attack and +20 Hit.  [Sme]
Thotslayer: +15 crit against units with Nice Thighs or Personality.  [Sme]
Heavy Blade: +4 Damage/-2 Attack Speed when unit’s Con. is bigger than the enemy.  [Mikey Seregon]
Dancing Blade: +4 Attack Speed/-2 Damage when unit’s Con. is lower than the enemy.  [Mikey Seregon]
Fire Boost: Grants +6 Attack if unit's current HP is at least 3 higher than the enemy's.  [Mikey Seregon]
Wind Boost: Grants +6 Attack Speed if unit's current HP is at least 3 higher than the enemy's.  [Mikey Seregon]
Earth Boost: Grants +6 Defense if unit's current HP is at least 3 higher than the enemy's.  [Mikey Seregon]
Water Boost: Grants +6 Resistance if unit's current HP is at least 3 higher than the enemy's.  [Mikey Seregon]
Air Raid: Grants +5 or +15 on a stat when on a tile enemy cannot enter  [Jopettajah]
Chaos Style: AS +3 during combat with a physical weapon against a foe armed with magic or vice versa.  [Jopettajah]
