Proc Skills
========================================

Adept: Gain a consecutive attack. (Speed % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Aegis: Nullify a magic attack. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Aether: First strike absorbs HP, second strike negates defenses. (Skill/2 % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Astra: 5 attacks at half damage. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Bane: Leave the opponent at 1 HP if the attack would kill. (Skill/2 % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Barricade: Damage taken is halved after first being struck.  [Snakey1]
Barricade+: In combat, damage recieved equals half of the damage when struck last.  [Snakey1]
Black Magic: Skill% chance to inflict a random status.  [Tequila]
Colossus: Triples Strength. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Corona: Negate enemy resistance. (Skill% activation)  [Sme]
Counter: Reflect physical damage when attacked at 1-2 range.  [Initial Commit]
Countermagic: Reflect magic damage when attacked at 1-2 range.  [Initial Commit]
Deadeye: Doubles hit rate. Skill% chance to inflict sleep.  [Sme]
Devil's Luck: Immune to Devil Reversal. Gives unit's Devil Reversal to the enemy. (31-Luck % chance of Devil Reversal).  [Leonarth]
Devil's Pact: Immune to Devil Reversal. Curses the enemy with Devil Reversal. (31-Luck % chance of Devil Reversal).  [Leonarth]
Devil's Whim: This unit is cursed, but the curse spreads to the enemy as well. (31-Luck % chance of Devil Reversal).  [Leonarth]
Down With Arch: If the hit lands, instantly kill the enemy unit. (Only if name starts with "Arch")
Dragon Fang: 1.5x damage. (Skill% activation)  [Sme]
Eclipse: Leave opponent with 1 HP. (Skill % activation)  [Sme]
Enrage: Inflict berserk status. (Skill% activation)  [Sme]
Flare: Halve enemy resistance. (Skill% activation)  [Sme]
Foresight: Avoid the damage from enemy Critical Hits and Skill Activations.  [Leonarth]
Ignis: Add Def/2 and Res/2 to damage dealt. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Impale: Deal 4x damage. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Lethality: Instantly kill opponent. (Skill/2 % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Luna: Negates enemy defenses. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Miracle: Survive a lethal attack if HP > 50%.  [Initial Commit]
Moonbow: Enemy Def/Res is reduced by 25%. Charge: 2  [Initial Commit]
Pavise: Nullify a physical attack. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Petrify: Inflict stone status. (Skill% activation)  [Sme]
Sol: Restore damage dealt as HP. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Sure Shot: A precision attack that always hits and does 1.5x damage. (Skill % activation)  [Initial Commit]
Corrosion: Decrease durability of enemy's weapon by User's level (Skill/2 % activation)  [Sme]
Glacies: Add unit's Resistance to damage dealt. (Skill % activation)  [Sme]
Great Shield: Negate all damage. (Defense % activation)  [Sme]
Vengeance: Add half of damage taken to damage dealt. (Skill % activation)  [Sme]

