Range Skills
========================================

Bow Range +1: Maximum range of equipped bows is increased.  [Teraspark]
Point Blank: Minimum range of equipped bows is set to 1.  [Teraspark]
Staff Savant: Maximum range of staves is increased by 1.  [Teraspark]
Tome Range +1: Maximum range of equipped tome is increased.  [Kirb]

========================================
Rounds Data Skills
========================================

Armsthrift: Luck % chance to not consume weapon durability.  [Initial Commit]
Dazzle: Opponents cannot counterattack this unit.  [circleseverywhere]
Desperation: If HP < 50%, double attacks occur immediately.  [??? (Initial Commit)]
Assassinate: When initiating battle at 1 range: +2 Damage, double attacks occur before counter.  [Zeta]
Prideful Warrior: This unit always attacks after the enemy, but always doubles.  [Vesly]

========================================
Doubling Skills
========================================

Moonlight: Cannot double but opponent cannot counterattack.  [Sme]
Reckless Fighter: Both units in combat always double.  [Vesly]
Wary Fighter: Unit cannot double or be doubled.  [Tequila]
Last Word: When doubled, this unit also doubles.  [Vesly]
Bold Fighter: When attacking, this unit always doubles.  [Vesly]
Vengeful Fighter: When defending, this unit always doubles.  [Vesly]
Quick Learner: When attacking a higher leveled enemy, this unit doubles.  [Vesly]
Passion's Flow: If gaining support bonuses, this unit always doubles while attacking.  [Vesly]
Biding Blow: If the opponent cannot counterattack, this unit doubles.  [Vesly]
Advantage Chaser: Unit always doubles when attacking with WTA.  [Jopettajah]

========================================
Stat Modifier Skills
========================================

Defiant Skills: When HP is 25% or lower, gain +4 to the given stat.  [Sme]
Resolve: When HP < 50%, gain 1.5x Str, Skl, & Spd.  [Sme]
Fortress Defense: +5 Def, -3 Str/Mag  [Leonarth]
Fortress Resistance: 5 Res, -3 Str/Mag  [Leonarth]
Life and Death: Grants +5 Atk/Mag/Spd, -5 Def/Res.  [Leonarth]
Push Skills: When HP is full, gain +5 to the given stat.  [Sme]
Lull Skills: Negate the effects of a rally for the given stat.  [Sme]
Guts: +5 Str while under any status condition. (Includes dancer rings.)  [Vesly]
Strong Constitution: +5 Def/Res while under any status condition. (Includes dancer rings.)  [Vesly]

========================================
Unit Menu Skills
========================================

Rally Skills: +4 to specified stat to allies within 2 tiles.  [Initial Commit]
Capture: Capture an enemy after defeating it with reduced stats.  [Tequila]
Dance: Refresh an ally unit to let them act again.  [Sme]
Gamble: A reckless attack with halved hit but doubled crit.  [Initial Commit]
Lunge: Swap places with the opponent after combat. (No effect if Move is --)  [Tequila]
Mercy: Enemies are left with at least 1 HP.  [Tequila]
Summon: Can conjure a phantom soldier to fight alongside you.  [Sme]
Supply: This unit has access to the convoy.  [Sme]
Shove: Allows unit to push other units one tile away.  [StanH]
Smite: Allows unit to push other units two tiles away.  [StanH]
Pivot: Allows unit to move to the opposite side of an adjacent ally.  [StanH]
Reposition: Allows unit to pull an adjacent ally to its opposite side.  [StanH]
Swap: Allows unit to swap positions with an adjacent ally.  [StanH]
Swarp: Allows unit to swap positions with a distant ally.  [Sme]
Steal: Unit can steal items.  [Tequila]
Steal+: Unit can steal unequipped weapons and staves if con>weight.  [Tequila]
Draw Back: Unit moves 1 space away from target ally. Ally moves to unit’s previous space.  [Vesly]
Sacrifice: Drains the user’s HP to restore the HP of another allied unit. It also cures status effects, with no HP cost to the user.  [Vesly]
Ardent Sacrifice: Restores 10 HP to target, but drops user’s HP by 10.  [Vesly]
Reciprocal Aid: User and target ally switch their current HP totals.  [Vesly]

========================================
Miscellaneous Skills
========================================

Savior: Can rescue without penalties.  [Initial Commit]
Discipline: Weapon experience gains are doubled.  [Initial Commit]
Vantage: If HP < 50%, strike first when attacked.  [Initial Commit]
Catch 'Em All: Grants the user every skill.  [Leonarth]
Vantage+: User always attacks first, even if attacked. Negates crits.  [SD9k]
Nihil: Cancels the opponent's skills in combat.  [Initial Commit]
Live to Serve: When healing an ally, also heals self.  [Initial Commit & Leonarth]
Locktouch: Can open locks without keys or picks.  [Kao]
Expertise: Reduce bonus damage from critical hits by 50%.  [Initial Commit]
Celerity: Movement +2.  [Initial Commit]
Dragon's Blood: Unit is able to activate Dragon Veins.  [Colorz]
Hero: +30% skill activation rate when HP is below 50%.  [Sme]
Rightful King: +10% to Skill activation rate.  [Initial Commit]
Rightful God: +30% to Skill activation rate.  [Initial Commit]
Rightful Arch: Sets Skill activation rate to 100%.  [Initial Commit]
Triangle Adept: Doubles weapon triangle effects for this unit.  [Tequila]
Triangle Adept+: Doubles weapon triangle effects.  [Sme]
Inspiring Tune: Refreshing a unit grants them +2 Pow/Def until the next turn.  [Leonarth]
Liquid Ooze: Attackers trying to gain HP from attacking this unit lose it instead.  [Leonarth]
Shadowgift: Allows the user to use Dark Magic. (Uses highest Magic Rank)  [Leonarth]
Lumina: Allows the user to use Light Magic. (Uses highest Magic Rank)  [Leonarth]
Discipline+: Weapon experience gains are doubled. Unit may S-Rank multiple weapon types.  [Zeta]
Watchful: This unit cannot be captured or stolen from.  [Sme]
Boon: Cure bad status effects at the beginning of each turn.  [Sme]
Synchronize: Statuses are also applied to the attacker.  [Sme]
Bargain: Halves prices in shops.  [Sme]
Poise: +1 Move. Negates enemy hit bonus from weapon triangle advantage.  [Zeta]
Amische: This unit's religion disallows them from using non-Iron weaponry.  [Sme]
Triangle Attack: Allows this unit to perform a triangle attack with 2 other units who have this skill.
Shrewd Potential: Stat boosters provide +1 more than usual.  [Vesly]
Biorhythm Skills: Double or halve biorhythm effects.  [Sme]
